  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1c48f655d92fd4db296dc049bfbb1ede, type: 3}
  itemDescription: 'Deep Sea Exploration Institute: This institute explores the deep
    ocean environments and marine technology. Its mission includes developing submersibles
    and underwater robotic systems, marine sensors, and conducting deep-sea scientific
    research (geological and biological). Focus areas are creating remotely operated
    vehicles (ROVs) and autonomous underwater vehicles (AUVs) that can explore the
    Red Sea depths, researching hydrocarbon seeps or mineral deposits on the seabed,
    and studying unique deep-sea ecosystems in the Red Sea and Arabian Gulf. The
    institute aims to support national interests in oceanography, undersea resource
    mapping, and biodiversity, leveraging technology for ocean exploration much like
    how space is explored. It collaborates on projects such as coral reef monitoring
    and subsea engineering solutions for offshore industries'
  description: 
